## Bounding Rule

Retain only the declared bounded window. When a consumer requests an older `since` interval, rebuild from authoritative/source-native history or report the unavailable portion `UNKNOWN / VERIFICATION_REQUIRED`; never silently truncate.

## Rebuild Rule

When `REBUILD_REQUIRED`, reconstruct from authoritative/source-native pointers. Never repair Project Source, Git history, Change Log, or relation truth to match this derived projection.
